= Helix workshop

You came from #note-link("Welcome/The_lighthouse")[the lighthouse], through
its backlinks. Now the hands-on part: the editor works like Helix. You first
*select* text, then say what to do with it.

Press `i` to edit this note. `w` selects the next word, `x` the whole line,
`d` deletes the selection, `u` undoes, `Escape` goes back to normal mode.
#note-link("Welcome/Helix_basics")[Helix basics] lists the other keys, with
exercises.

